-- the header: m+0 the next fresh node, m+8 the next fresh variable, m+16 the redexes, m+24 the
-- interactions, m+32 the free nodes, m+40 the free variables, m+48 the links waiting.
-- A variable holds its target plus one; zero is no target.
-- a store, then the base given back through the store's own result: every step after a store
-- is a function of it, so nothing that follows can be lifted out ahead of the store
hv2-u : Word → Unit → Word
hv2-u m unit = m
